WEBVTT

00:00:08.846 --> 00:00:11.196
POPPY: So one of these tunnels
leads to the Troll Tree.

00:00:11.239 --> 00:00:12.284
BRANCH: That's right.

00:00:12.327 --> 00:00:14.155
There's so many of them.

00:00:14.199 --> 00:00:15.635
I wonder which one.

00:00:15.678 --> 00:00:17.202
I don't know.

00:00:17.245 --> 00:00:20.553
MALE VOICE:
Choose a hole wisely!

00:00:20.596 --> 00:00:23.817
For one will lead
to Bergen Town...

00:00:23.861 --> 00:00:26.994
and the others,
to certain death.
[ECHOING]

00:00:27.038 --> 00:00:28.474
Who said that?

00:00:28.517 --> 00:00:30.693
MALE VOICE: It was...

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:33.000
me.

00:00:33.044 --> 00:00:35.960
Hey, guys, how's it going?
Welcome to the root tunnels.

00:00:36.003 --> 00:00:37.309
Uh, I just wanted
to warn you.

00:00:37.352 --> 00:00:39.485
One of these tunnels leads
to the Troll Tree...

00:00:39.528 --> 00:00:41.661
and the others to
[IN DEEP VOICE]
certain death,

00:00:41.704 --> 00:00:42.967
death, death, death...

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.838
[IMITATES ECHO FADING]

00:00:44.882 --> 00:00:47.145
Do you think you can tell us
which is the right one?

00:00:47.188 --> 00:00:48.233
You bet!

00:00:48.276 --> 00:00:49.321
Great!No, that's okay.

00:00:49.364 --> 00:00:50.452
We're fine, thanks!

00:00:50.496 --> 00:00:51.584
Branch.
[CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY]

00:00:51.627 --> 00:00:52.846
He's trying to help us.

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:54.500
I don't like the looks of him.

00:00:54.543 --> 00:00:56.763
I mean,
who wears socks
with no shoes?

00:00:58.112 --> 00:01:00.288
He seems to know
what he's talking about.

00:01:01.202 --> 00:01:03.509
Okay, fine.

00:01:03.552 --> 00:01:04.989
Which way do we go?

00:01:05.032 --> 00:01:06.599
First, you have to
give me a high five.

00:01:06.642 --> 00:01:07.861
Then I'll tell you.

00:01:07.905 --> 00:01:08.949
What?

00:01:08.993 --> 00:01:10.037
Oh, I love high fives.
I'll do it.

00:01:10.081 --> 00:01:11.430
Oh, I know you'll do it.

00:01:12.213 --> 00:01:13.562
But will he?

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:15.608
All right, dumpy diapers,
up high!

00:01:15.651 --> 00:01:17.001
Nope, I don't do high fives.

00:01:17.044 --> 00:01:18.698
Slap it, boss.Not gonna happen.

00:01:18.741 --> 00:01:20.439
Party on the top floor.Nope.

00:01:20.482 --> 00:01:21.875
Little slappy.
Make daddy happy.

00:01:21.919 --> 00:01:23.007
That's weird.

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:24.747
Come on,
just one little high five.

00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:26.619
Oh, no, thanks. I'm good.

00:01:26.662 --> 00:01:28.229
Here, just do this...

00:01:28.273 --> 00:01:29.535
But with your hand.

00:01:29.578 --> 00:01:31.015
Thank you
for that demonstration.

00:01:31.058 --> 00:01:33.104
Really cleared up exactly
what I will not be doing.

00:01:33.147 --> 00:01:35.106
Branch, it's a high five.

00:01:35.149 --> 00:01:36.759
The others
lead to certain death.

00:01:36.803 --> 00:01:38.239
Get perspective.

00:01:41.242 --> 00:01:43.723
[SIGHS] One high five
and then you'll tell us

00:01:43.766 --> 00:01:45.116
which tunnel to take, right?

00:01:45.159 --> 00:01:46.378
So easy.

00:01:46.421 --> 00:01:47.901
[GRUNTS] Okay, fine!

00:01:47.945 --> 00:01:49.250
Ooh. Too slow.

00:01:49.294 --> 00:01:50.556
Too slow?

00:01:50.599 --> 00:01:51.992
[LAUGHS]

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:54.473
[CHUCKLES] Classic.

00:01:54.516 --> 00:01:56.214
No, no. All right.

00:01:56.257 --> 00:01:58.607
I'm gonna let you slide
with a fist bump.

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:01.045
Whoo. Shark attack!
Nom-nom-nom-nom. Jellyfish!

00:02:01.088 --> 00:02:02.655
Hand sandwich. Turkey.
Snowman. Dolphin.

00:02:02.698 --> 00:02:04.222
Helicopter. Last Supper.
Monkey in a zoo.

00:02:04.265 --> 00:02:05.571
What?Gear shift

00:02:05.614 --> 00:02:07.138
[IMITATES GEARS SHIFTING]

00:02:11.185 --> 00:02:12.621
[BOTH LAUGHING]

00:02:14.972 --> 00:02:17.191
Okay, okay, okay.
Now I'm thinking we hug.

00:02:18.366 --> 00:02:19.498
[THUNDER RUMBLING]

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:21.282
[SCREAMING]

00:02:21.326 --> 00:02:22.588
BRANCH: That's right.
You better run, Cloud!

00:02:22.631 --> 00:02:23.937
POPPY: Wait!

00:02:23.981 --> 00:02:25.417
I'm gonna tear
your little cloud arms...

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:26.984
off your cloud body,

00:02:27.027 --> 00:02:28.768
and high five
your face with them!

00:02:28.811 --> 00:02:30.596
POPPY: He's just a cloud!

00:02:30.639 --> 00:02:32.641
BRANCH: Get back here!POPPY: Branch! He can help us!

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:33.860
BRANCH: Come back!

00:02:33.904 --> 00:02:34.948
POPPY: Run, Cloud Guy!

00:02:34.992 --> 00:02:36.123
I'm gonna kill you!

00:02:36.167 --> 00:02:37.951
Ta-da! We're here!

00:02:37.995 --> 00:02:39.344
Phew...

00:02:39.387 --> 00:02:41.302
You guys are a lot of fun.
You know, I gotta go.

00:02:41.346 --> 00:02:42.956
Got some cloud stuff
to take care of.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.827
Catch you
on the way back?

00:02:44.871 --> 00:02:46.264
Unless...

00:02:46.307 --> 00:02:47.961
you die.
[IMITATES ECHO FADING]

00:02:49.832 --> 00:02:51.617
The Troll Tree.

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:53.358
Bergen Town.

00:02:59.799 --> 00:03:01.496
[CLINT EASTWOODPLAYING]

00:03:08.329 --> 00:03:10.766
ALL: ♪ I ain't happy
I'm feeling glad

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:15.293
♪ I got sunshine in a bag
I'm useless

00:03:15.336 --> 00:03:19.297
♪ But not for long
The future is coming on

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.300
♪ I ain't happy
I'm feeling glad

00:03:22.343 --> 00:03:27.174
♪ I got sunshine in a bag
I'm useless

00:03:27.218 --> 00:03:30.961
♪ But not for long
The future is coming on

00:03:31.004 --> 00:03:34.007
♪ Is coming on
Is coming on

00:03:34.051 --> 00:03:36.531
♪ Coming on
Is coming on

00:03:36.575 --> 00:03:39.273
♪ Is coming on
Is coming on ♪

00:03:39.317 --> 00:03:42.885
Wow! They're as
miserable as you.

00:03:42.929 --> 00:03:46.541
Which means they haven't
eaten a Troll yet.

00:03:46.585 --> 00:03:48.630
Now, come on.
Let's go save our friends.

00:03:48.674 --> 00:03:49.675
Your friends.

00:03:49.718 --> 00:03:51.894
Our friends.
Don't fight it.

00:03:58.423 --> 00:04:00.077
[SIGHING]

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.861
Oh, Barnabus.

00:04:01.904 --> 00:04:05.082
You're my only friend
in this whole miserable world.

00:04:06.953 --> 00:04:08.215
Dad was right.

00:04:10.043 --> 00:04:13.873
I'll never ever,
never ever, never be happy.

00:04:13.916 --> 00:04:15.048
[GROANS]

00:04:15.092 --> 00:04:16.180
Never.

00:04:16.223 --> 00:04:20.401
CHEF: Never say never.

00:04:27.452 --> 00:04:28.453
[SHRIEKS]

00:04:30.237 --> 00:04:31.934
[GROWLING]

00:04:31.978 --> 00:04:33.806
Chad. Todd.

00:04:35.242 --> 00:04:36.330
[GASPS]

00:04:36.374 --> 00:04:38.158
Chef, where did
you come from?

00:04:38.202 --> 00:04:41.074
My father banished you
20 years ago.

00:04:41.118 --> 00:04:43.381
Have you been standing behind
that plant this whole time?

00:04:43.424 --> 00:04:45.339
If only, sire.

00:04:45.383 --> 00:04:47.254
No. I've been out
in the wilderness...

00:04:47.298 --> 00:04:51.911
thinking of nothing
but how I let you down.

00:04:51.954 --> 00:04:54.957
If only there was some way
I could make you feel better.

00:04:55.001 --> 00:04:56.089
Well, fat chance!

00:04:56.133 --> 00:04:57.395
The only way
I'll ever be happy

00:04:57.438 --> 00:04:58.874
is by eating a Troll...

00:04:58.918 --> 00:05:00.876
and that ain't gonna happen,
thanks to you.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:04.271
Ah, but it just might.
Thanks to me.

00:05:04.315 --> 00:05:06.012
[TROLL CHOIR SINGING]

00:05:06.752 --> 00:05:07.970
[ALL GASPING]

00:05:14.629 --> 00:05:17.241
You found the Trolls.

00:05:17.284 --> 00:05:19.286
Whoa.[ALL GASPING]

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:23.595
So this means I might
actually get to be happy!

00:05:23.638 --> 00:05:24.726
That's right.

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:26.424
[EXCLAIMING IN DELIGHT][TROLLS GASPING]

00:05:26.467 --> 00:05:28.426
Of course,
everyone else in Bergen Town

00:05:28.469 --> 00:05:30.210
will still be miserable...

00:05:30.254 --> 00:05:32.473
but that's not
your concern.

00:05:32.517 --> 00:05:35.781
I am their king,
so maybe it kinda is.

00:05:35.824 --> 00:05:38.131
What exactly
are you proposing?

00:05:38.175 --> 00:05:41.569
Bringing back Trollstice?
For everyone?

00:05:41.613 --> 00:05:42.788
Hmm...

00:05:42.831 --> 00:05:45.138
Yes! That's exactly
what I'm proposing.

00:05:45.182 --> 00:05:47.749
Great idea, sire.
Absolutely brilliant.

00:05:47.793 --> 00:05:49.011
Aren't you smart?

00:05:49.055 --> 00:05:50.448
[CHUCKLES] I guess I am.

00:05:50.491 --> 00:05:53.494
And I, your loyal Chef,
will be right behind you.

00:05:53.538 --> 00:05:55.496
Holding a knife.What's that?

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.411
Holding a knife,
a spoon, a ladle.

00:05:57.455 --> 00:05:59.283
I'm your chef, after all!

00:05:59.326 --> 00:06:01.023
Yeah, you sure are!

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:06.420
I'm back!

00:06:06.464 --> 00:06:08.292
You, scullery maid,
what's your name?

00:06:08.335 --> 00:06:09.510
Uh, Bridget.

00:06:09.554 --> 00:06:11.338
Congratulations, Idget.
You work for me now.

00:06:11.382 --> 00:06:12.687
So you take
those dishes downstairs

00:06:12.731 --> 00:06:14.254
and you start scrubbing.

00:06:14.298 --> 00:06:16.300
Yes, Chef.
Thank you, Chef.

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:19.868
[TROLLS SCREAMING]

00:06:22.175 --> 00:06:23.481
[ALL WHIMPERING]

00:06:23.524 --> 00:06:25.483
Shh. Don't cry,
Mr. Dinkles. Shh!

00:06:25.526 --> 00:06:28.181
Guys, Mr. Dinkles
is really freaking out!

00:06:28.877 --> 00:06:30.183
[SQUEAKS]

00:06:30.227 --> 00:06:34.492
Whoa, whoa! Everyone,
we must all remain calm.

00:06:34.535 --> 00:06:36.798
[CHANTING] ♪ Comb

00:06:36.842 --> 00:06:37.843
That's right.[GASPS]

00:06:37.886 --> 00:06:41.499
A calm Troll
is a tasty Troll.

00:06:41.542 --> 00:06:45.285
And you are a key ingredient
in my recipe for success.

00:06:45.329 --> 00:06:46.678
[TROLLS GASPING]You see...

00:06:46.721 --> 00:06:49.376
he who controls the Trolls
controls the Kingdom.

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:52.292
And I am that "he!"

00:06:52.336 --> 00:06:54.251
You're a dude?[GRUNTS]

00:06:56.383 --> 00:06:57.384
Ahh!

00:06:58.255 --> 00:06:59.386
Ooh.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:02.172
By this time tomorrow,
I'll be queen...

00:07:02.215 --> 00:07:03.695
and all of Bergen Town
will get

00:07:03.738 --> 00:07:05.479
exactly what they deserve.

00:07:05.523 --> 00:07:08.221
True happiness!

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.050
[CHEF LAUGHING MANIACALLY]

00:07:11.093 --> 00:07:12.094
[CAWING]

00:07:18.623 --> 00:07:20.146
Chad.Todd.

